Applied Finite Mathematics: XYZ Homework edition
================================================

This repository holds XYZ Homework's adaptation of "Applied Finite Mathematics" by
Rupinder Sekhon (De Anza College), originally published on OpenStax CNX (cnx.org,
collection col10613) under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 license (CC BY 3.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Changes were made.

