    accessibility repairs (tables and image descriptions). The git history records each
    change.

m18906, section "Binomial Theorem" (element ids beginning "xyz-bt-")
    Adapted from section 7.7 "Binomial Theorem" of "Applied Finite Mathematics (Sekhon
    and Bloom)" by Rupinder Sekhon and Roberta Bloom, LibreTexts,
    https://math.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Applied_Mathematics/Applied_Finite_Mathematics_(Sekhon_and_Bloom),
    CC BY 4.0 (page last modified 2025-08-14). Changes: re-expressed in CNXML/MathML;
    corrected the printed coefficient of the second term of (x+y)^4 (4x^3y) and two
    typographical errors (x^6, 7C0); restated the general-term rule. The section ends with
    an attribution note (id "xyz-bt-attribution") so the credit travels with the content.

